            "text": "<p>With 38L tank, suction tubes, castors and fittings all moulded from thick-skinned stainless steel. Reinforced 9m cable with toughened PVC and anti-crush 38mm diameter hose system for collecting larger debris. The WD L38 is build to last.</p>",
